text = "BLACK CREEK & WESTERN RY. — TELEGRAPH DEPT. — ORDER 41

E. CRANE TO RELIEVE NIGHT OPERATOR AT BLACK CREEK (CALL: BC).
MINE JUNCTION (MJ) HAS BEEN SEALED SINCE THE FLOOD OF OCT. 1885.
CHECK THE TIMETABLE AND DISPATCH LEDGER BEFORE OPENING THE LINE.
KEEP THE WIRE. COPY WHAT COMES."
